## Third-Party Licenses

This project includes the following third-party components:

### Hardware Libraries

**MFRC522 Library** (Arduino)
- License: Public Domain / Unlicense
- Source: https://github.com/miguelbalboa/rfid
- Used for: RFID card reading

**Arduino_LED_Matrix**
- License: LGPL-2.1
- Source: https://github.com/arduino-libraries/Arduino_LED_Matrix
- Used for: 8x13 LED matrix control

**Arduino_RouterBridge**
- License: LGPL-2.1
- Source: https://github.com/arduino-libraries/Arduino_RouterBridge
- Used for: MCU-MPU communication

### Python Libraries

**FastAPI**
- License: MIT
- Source: https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi
- Used for: Web API framework

**Uvicorn**
- License: BSD-3-Clause
