---

## Educational Use

This project is designed for educational purposes, specifically for teaching
phishing awareness and cybersecurity concepts in college environments.

The phishing message corpus (`python/corpus.json`) contains fictional examples
created for educational purposes only. All domains use reserved TLDs (.example,
.invalid) and do not represent real organizations.

