## Acknowledgments

This project was inspired by:
- Real phishing campaigns targeting Indian students
- Arcade game design principles
- Security awareness training best practices
- The Arduino community and open-source contributors

Special thanks to:
- Arduino for the UNO Q platform
- The open-source community for the libraries used
- Students who tested early versions and provided feedback
